Z||000034||jonny_blaze||11-15-2000||05:21 PM||||i am a stereo guy, i worked at a shop, and im in electronics engineering in college.<BR>thats why when someone says a box has to be 30"x24"x18" i know that is goddamn big.  way too big to fit in a fiero.  <P><BR>orief, the box you stated would be 7.5 cubes.  say this with me"jonny is right, i orief was wrong" its ok man, just admit that you were wrong.<P>im going to be using eitehr infinity(doubt it) or the aluminum eclipse subs.  the eclipse work in as little as.65 cu ft, you just have to send kileer power to them.....i HAD rockfords before, in a different car.<P>the box im making for the fiero will be mostly fiberglass so dimensions are hard to give you. ill have to work in liters. 1 cuft=28.316 liters so ill be able to calculate the volume<BR>i hope i taught you all something, i come form a higher stereo world then this, dont question my knowldge....||||reg||1
